# Vitest unit tests
- Focus on business logic and pure helpers (SRS, interleaving, migrations, validators, prompt builders).
- Mock dependencies with `vi.mock` / injected fakes; use fake timers (`vi.useFakeTimers`), `fake-indexeddb`, a mocked `fetch`. No real network.
- Cover valid input, invalid input, and edge cases (undefined, wrong types, empty, boundary dates).
- Descriptive names (`it('schedules next review in 6 days after second correct answer')`), grouped in `describe`. Arrange/Act/Assert.
- `vi.clearAllMocks()` / `vi.useRealTimers()` in before/afterEach.
- Typed mocks: `vi.mocked(fn)`, never `as any`.
- Keep each file focused; split it when it grows past one unit.
